# No AI / Cursor git credit

When committing, amending, rebasing, pushing, or opening PRs in this repo:

- Do **not** add `Co-authored-by:` for Cursor, Copilot, Claude, agents, or any AI.
- Do **not** put Cursor/agent names, emails (`cursoragent@cursor.com`), links, or trailers in commit messages, PR titles, PR bodies, or git notes.
- Author and committer = the human user's normal git identity only.
- If a tool injects AI co-author text, strip it before push (amend / rewrite). Never force-push `main`/`master` unless the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer the repo hook at `.githooks/commit-msg` (enabled via `npm install` / `core.hooksPath`).
